#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:127
msgid "**• What is Mirai?**"
msgstr "**• Qu’est-ce que Mirai ?**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:129
msgid ""
"Mirai is a malware strain that infects Internet‑of‑Things (IoT) devices such "
"as cameras, DVRs, and routers."
msgstr ""
"Mirai est une souche de malware qui infecte les appareils Internet des "
"objets (IoT) tels que caméras, DVR et routeurs."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:131
msgid "**• How it Works**"
msgstr "**• Comment ça fonctionne**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:133
msgid ""
"It scans the internet for devices protected by default or weak credentials, "
"infects them, and recruits them into a large botnet."
msgstr ""
"Il scanne Internet à la recherche d’appareils protégés par des identifiants "
"par défaut ou faibles, les infecte et les recrute dans un vaste botnet."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:135
msgid "**• Impact (2016)**"
msgstr "**• Impact (2016)**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:137
msgid ""
"Mirai executed one of the largest DDoS attacks in history against DNS "
"provider Dyn, which caused outages for: Twitter • Netflix • Reddit • GitHub "
"• Spotify • Airbnb and more."
msgstr ""
"Mirai a exécuté l’une des plus grandes attaques DDoS de l’histoire contre le "
"fournisseur DNS Dyn, provoquant des interruptions pour : Twitter • Netflix • "
"Reddit • GitHub • Spotify • Airbnb et autres."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:140
msgid "**• Why It Matters Today**"
msgstr "**• Pourquoi c’est important aujourd’hui**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:142
msgid ""
"Mirai source code was publicly leaked, leading to many copycat botnets and "
"highlighting the dangers of insecure IoT devices."
msgstr ""
"Le code source de Mirai a été divulgué publiquement, entraînant de nombreux "
"botnets imitateurs et soulignant les dangers des appareils IoT non sécurisés."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:146
msgid "🧩 **Advanced Malware Concepts**"
msgstr "🧩 **Concepts avancés de malware**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:148
msgid "**• Fileless Malware**"
msgstr "**• Malware sans fichier**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:150
msgid ""
"Operates in memory without writing files to disk, making it difficult to "
"detect."
msgstr ""
"Fonctionne en mémoire sans écrire de fichiers sur le disque, ce qui le rend "
"difficile à détecter."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:152
msgid "**• Polymorphic Malware**"
msgstr "**• Malware polymorphe**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:154
msgid "Regularly changes its code signature to evade antivirus tools."
msgstr ""
"Change régulièrement sa signature de code pour échapper aux outils antivirus."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:156
msgid "**• Rootkits**"
msgstr "**• Rootkits**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:158
msgid "Hide malicious activity by modifying system-level components."
msgstr "Cache l’activité malveillante en modifiant les composants du système."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:160
msgid "**• Supply‑Chain Malware**"
msgstr "**• Malware de la chaîne d’approvisionnement**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:162
msgid ""
"Targets trusted providers or software updates to infiltrate many "
"organizations at once."
msgstr ""
"Cible des fournisseurs de confiance ou des mises à jour logicielles pour "
"infiltrer simultanément de nombreuses organisations."

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:166
msgid "🛡️ **Defensive Mindset: Key Malware Mitigation Concepts**"
msgstr "🛡️ **Approche défensive : concepts clés de mitigation des malwares**"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:168
msgid "Keep operating systems and software fully patched"
msgstr "Maintenir les systèmes d’exploitation et logiciels entièrement à jour"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:169
msgid "Use endpoint protection and behavioral monitoring"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser la protection des terminaux et la surveillance comportementale"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:170
msgid "Apply least‑privilege principles"
msgstr "Appliquer les principes du moindre privilège"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:171
msgid "Maintain tested offline backups"
msgstr "Maintenir des sauvegardes hors ligne testées"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:172
msgid "Filter email attachments and block macros"
msgstr "Filtrer les pièces jointes des emails et bloquer les macros"

#: src/cybersecurity/attacks/malware.md:173
msgid "Segment networks to prevent broad infection spread"
msgstr ""
"Segmenter les réseaux pour empêcher une propagation étendue des infections"

